  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OIL SPILL DRIFT FORECAST</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">OIL SPILL DRIFT FORECAST</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to provide Latvia and Lithuania with an improved capacity to handle major spills in the Baltic Sea and thereby minimise marine environmental impact and clean-up costs. The following activities will be carried out: collection of facts,trainingand education, implementation of prognosis model for oil spill etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utvecklingsm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att, genom att f&#xf6;rse Lettland och Litauen med tek-nisk och operativ kapacitet att hantera st&#xf6;rre oljeutsl&#xe4;ppsolyckor, minimera risken f&#xf6;r skadliga effekter p&#xe5; &#xd6;stersj&#xf6;n. F&#xf6;ljande aktivi- teter kommer att ing&#xe5;: faktainsamling, implementering av prognos- modellen f&#xf6;r oljeutsl&#xe4;pp, utbildning, projektuppf&#xf6;ljning mm.</narrative>
  </description>
